  - "A, Just finished up in Duluth! Six stations down, six to go. \n\nDid you know
    Hercules\u2019s first task was to kill the Nemean lion? It was unkillable, but
    he pulled it off. I wonder if Hercules ever felt lonely. Or worried that he\u2019d
    fail. \n\nYou\u2019ve seen my notes about the Leonids, so you know why Leo\u2019s
    on my mind. I just hope we can figure this out in time. \n\n\"Doubt thou the
    stars are fire, doubt that the sun doth move, doubt truth to be a liar... but
    never doubt I love.\"\n-E"
